25.32,0:02:25.73,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,ideDialogue: 0,0:02:25.78,0:02:26.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,WeDialogue: 0,0:02:26.02,0:02:26.44,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,fightDialogue: 0,0:02:26.24,0:02:26.67,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,toDialogue: 0,0:02:26.47,0:02:26.96,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,geDialogue: 0,0:02:26.76,0:02:28.10,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,therDialogue: 0,0:02:33.40,0:02:34.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Here I come!Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.70,0:02:37.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Rubber Rubber...Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.07,0:02:39.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Pistol!Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.68,0:02:45.48,Main,,0,0,0,,What the hell...Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.05,0:02:48.25,Main,,0,0,0,,do you think you're doing?!Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.78,0:02:50.15,Main,,0,0,0,,One point!Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.12,0:02:58.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Like I keep saying,Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.26,0:03:01.72,Main,,0,0,0,,what is that power good for anyway?Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.66,0:03:06.03,Title,,30,0,250,,Oath of BrotherhoodDialogue: 1,0:02:58.66,0:03:06.03,Title,,30,0,250,,Oath of BrotherhoodDialogue: 0,0:03:01.72,0:03:07.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Dammit! It's not working! I'm so close!Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.23,0:03:08.80,Main,,0,0,0,,One more time!Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.80,0:03:12.50,Main,,0,0,0,,No! The rule is only 100  matches per person a day.Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.50,0:03:13.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait until tomorrow.Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.91,0:03:17.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy lost 50 times to Ace and me.Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.71,0:03:21.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Me vs. Ace is 24 - 26.Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.28,0:03:24.12,Main,,0,0,0,,I lost by two. Dammit!Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.12,0:03:28.39,Main,,0,0,0,,You guys! When I become 10  years old, I'll beat you two up!Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.39,0:03:32.62,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll be 13 then.  Let's go get something for dinner.Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.37,0:03:42.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay, crocodile sounds good!Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.97,0:03:45.30,Main,,0,0,0,,I love crocodile!Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.30,0:03:48.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy, don't get eaten this time.Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.84,0:03:51.54,Main,,0,0,0,,You survived last time only because you were swallowed whole.Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.85,0:03:56.52,Main,,0,0,0,,You wait here, Luffy.  You can't swim so you'd slow us down...Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.78,0:03:58.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Crocodile!Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.82,0:04:01.75,Main,,0,0,0,,– What?! – I said "wait"!!Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.88,0:04:15.40,Narrator,,0,0,0,,The inhospitable environment of Mount Colubo conditioned them day by day.Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.44,0:04:19.22,Narrator,,0,0,0,,To the north of the mountain...Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.31,0:04:24.31,Narrator,,0,0,0,,lies the final destination for anything estranged from society. It is called the Gray Terminal.Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.41,0:04:27.41,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Even further north...Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.41,0:04:33.12,Narrator,,0,0,0,,stands a city enclosed by an impenetrable stone wall.Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.32,0:04:41.23,Narrator,,0,0,0,,The great gate is the only entrance,Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.69,0:04:48.03,Narrator,,0,0,0,,through which loads of junk from all over the country pass twice a day.Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.57,0:04:54.04,Main,,0,0,0,,– Oh, here they come! – It's scavenging time!Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.41,0:05:00.71,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Denizens of the Gray Terminal occasionally visit the city to sell salvaged products.Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.48,0:05:08.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait! What's that you're carrying?Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.80,0:05:13.76,Main,,0,0,0,,It's a crocodile hide. I'm here to sell it.Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.76,0:05:14.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Crocodile?Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.53,0:05:18.83,Main,,0,0,0,,G-Go ahead!Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.50,0:05:25.90,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Beyond the great gate, pedestrians mark a wide avenue.Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.90,0:05:27.61,Narrator,,0,0,0,,It leads to Edge Town.Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.81,0:05:38.72,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Edge Town is a hangout for street punks and gangsters.Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.89,0:05:48.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, pops! Leave that here!Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.00,0:05:54.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, why don't you say something?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.87,0:05:56.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up, punk.Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.27,0:05:57.20,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.94,0:06:02.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Y-You little...Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.34,0:06:04.18,Main,,0,0,0,,If you're gonna be a mugger,Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.78,0:06:08.55,Main,,0,0,0,,be careful who you target!Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.68,0:06:12.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Th-They are...Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.39,0:06:14.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's do this!Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.55,0:06:15.89,Main,,0,0,0,,– Yeah! – Right!Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.24,0:06:38.21,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Further into the city, another high stone wall rises...Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.21,0:06:44.15,Narrator,,0,0,0,,to surround High Town,  where royalty and nobility reside.Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.32,0:06:50.19,Narrator,,0,0,0,,This country is called Goa.Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.19,0:06:51.62,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Its streets are free of litter,Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.62,0:06:55.43,Narrator,,0,0,0,,and it is said to be the most  beautiful country in the East Blue.Dialogue: 3,0:06:58.56,0:07:00.87,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Foosha Village, where Luffy was born,Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.33,0:07:00.53,Sign-Map,,0,0,0,,m -58 -57 l 64 -57 64 9 -58 9Dialogue: 1,0:07:00.33,0:07:00.53,Sign-Map,,0,0,0,,PalaceDialogue: 0,0:07:00.33,0:07:00.53,Sign-Map,,0,0,0,,m -62 -75 l 64 -75 64 2 -62 2Dialogue: 1,0:07:00.33,0:07:00.53,Sign-Map,,0,0,0,,Mount  ColuboDialogue: 0,0:07:00.33,0:07:00.80,Sign-Map,,0,0,0,,m -67 -58 l 71 -58 71 20 -67 20Dialogue: 1,0:07:00.33,0:07:00.80,Sign-Map,,0,0,0,,High TownDialogue: 0,0:07:00.33,0:07:00.80,Sign-Map,,0,0,0,,m -65 -79 l 74 -79 74 2 -65 2Dialogue: 1,0:07:00.33,0:07:00.80,Sign-Map,,0,0,0,,MidtownDialogue: 0,0:07:00.33,0:07:00.80,Sign-Map,,0,0,0,,m -59 -76 l 53 -76 53 -4 -59 -4Dialogue: 1,0:07:00.33,0:07:00.80,Sign-Map,,0,0,0,,Edge  TownDialogue: 0,0:07:00.33,0:07:00.80,Sign-Map,,0,0,0,,m -69 -81 l 73 -81 73 14 -69 14Dialogue: 1,0:07:00.33,0:07:00.80,Sign-Map,,0,0,0,,Gray  TerminalDialogue: 0,0:07:00.33,0:07:00.80,Sign-Map,,0,0,0,,m -83 -62 l 65 -62 65 14 -83 14Dialogue: 