y jumped out of the window!Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.03,0:08:41.83,Main,,0,0,0,,This is the fourth floor!Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.83,0:08:46.04,Main,,0,0,0,,We're out 26 bowls of ramen and a window!Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.47,0:08:50.04,Main,,0,0,0,,M-Manager! They left a note!Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.41,0:08:52.44,Sign-Independent,,0,0,0,,PUT IT ON MY  TREASURE TAB  - LUFFYDialogue: 0,0:08:52.44,0:08:52.48,Sign-Independent,,0,0,0,,PUT IT ON MY  TREASURE TAB  - LUFFYDialogue: 0,0:08:52.48,0:08:52.51,Sign-Independent,,0,0,0,,PUT IT ON MY  TREASURE TAB  - LUFFYDialogue: 0,0:08:52.51,0:08:52.54,Sign-Independent,,0,0,0,,PUT IT ON MY  TREASURE TAB  - LUFFYDialogue: 0,0:08:52.54,0:08:52.58,Sign-Independent,,0,0,0,,PUT IT ON MY  TREASURE TAB  - LUFFYDialogue: 0,0:08:52.58,0:08:52.61,Sign-Independent,,0,0,0,,PUT IT ON MY  TREASURE TAB  - LUFFYDialogue: 0,0:08:52.61,0:08:52.64,Sign-Independent,,0,0,0,,PUT IT ON MY  TREASURE TAB  - LUFFYDialogue: 0,0:08:52.64,0:08:52.68,Sign-Independent,,0,0,0,,PUT IT ON MY  TREASURE TAB  - LUFFYDialogue: 0,0:08:52.68,0:08:52.71,Sign-Independent,,0,0,0,,PUT IT ON MY  TREASURE TAB  - LUFFYDialogue: 0,0:08:52.71,0:08:52.74,Sign-Independent,,0,0,0,,PUT IT ON MY  TREASURE TAB  - LUFFYDialogue: 0,0:08:52.74,0:08:52.78,Sign-Independent,,0,0,0,,PUT IT ON MY  TREASURE TAB  - LUFFYDialogue: 0,0:08:52.78,0:08:52.81,Sign-Independent,,0,0,0,,PUT IT ON MY  TREASURE TAB  - LUFFYDialogue: 0,0:08:52.81,0:08:52.84,Sign-Independent,,0,0,0,,PUT IT ON MY  TREASURE TAB  - LUFFYDialogue: 0,0:08:52.84,0:08:52.88,Sign-Independent,,0,0,0,,PUT IT ON MY  TREASURE TAB  - LUFFYDialogue: 0,0:08:52.88,0:08:52.91,Sign-Independent,,0,0,0,,PUT IT ON MY  TREASURE TAB  - LUFFYDialogue: 0,0:08:52.91,0:08:52.94,Sign-Independent,,0,0,0,,PUT IT ON MY  TREASURE TAB  - LUFFYDialogue: 0,0:08:52.94,0:08:52.98,Sign-Independent,,0,0,0,,PUT IT ON MY  TREASURE TAB  - LUFFYDialogue: 0,0:08:52.98,0:08:53.01,Sign-Independent,,0,0,0,,PUT IT ON MY  TREASURE TAB  - LUFFYDialogue: 0,0:08:53.01,0:08:53.04,Sign-Indepen