rt of Goa.Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.87,0:09:54.44,Main,,0,0,0,,That's what I thought.Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.44,0:09:56.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Take it easy, Boss.Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.48,0:10:01.98,Main,,0,0,0,,It's rare to see you reading a newspaper.  Hell must be freezing over.Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.98,0:10:03.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Ouch!Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.88,0:10:06.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Somebody's gonna visit the kingdom?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.75,0:10:10.29,Main,,0,0,0,,It's making the headlines...Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.02,0:10:14.19,Main,,0,0,0,,What's going on here? Are they that big a deal?Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.86,0:10:17.20,Main,,0,0,0,,These Celestial Dragons?Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.23,0:10:15.26,Captions,,0,0,0,,A CELESTIAL DRAGON WILL VISITDialogue: 0,0:10:15.26,0:10:15.29,Captions,,0,0,0,,A CELESTIAL DRAGON WILL VISITDialogue: 0,0:10:15.29,0:10:15.33,Captions,,0,0,0,,A CELESTIAL DRAGON WILL VISITDialogue: 0,0:10:15.33,0:10:15.36,Captions,,0,0,0,,A CELESTIAL DRAGON WILL VISITDialogue: 0,0:10:15.36,0:10:15.39,Captions,,0,0,0,,A CELESTIAL DRAGON WILL VISITDialogue: 0,0:10:15.39,0:10:15.43,Captions,,0,0,0,,A CELESTIAL DRAGON WILL VISITDialogue: 0,0:10:15.43,0:10:15.46,Captions,,0,0,0,,A CELESTIAL DRAGON WILL VISITDialogue: 0,0:10:15.46,0:10:15.49,Captions,,0,0,0,,A CELESTIAL DRAGON WILL VISITDialogue: 0,0:10:15.49,0:10:15.53,Captions,,0,0,0,,A CELESTIAL DRAGON WILL VISITDialogue: 0,0:10:15.53,0:10:15.56,Captions,,0,0,0,,A CELESTIAL DRAGON WILL VISITDialogue: 0,0:10:15.56,0:10:15.59,Captions,,0,0,0,,A CELESTIAL DRAGON WILL VISITDialogue: 0,0:10:15.59,0:10:15.63,Captions,,0,0,0,,A CELESTIAL DRAGON WILL VISITDialogue: 0,0:10:15.63,0:10:15.66,Captions,,0,0,0,,A CELESTIAL DRAGON WILL VISITDialogue: 0,0:10:15.66,0:10:15.69,Captions,,0,0,0,,A CELESTIAL DRAGON WILL VISITDialogue: 0,0:10:15.69,0:10:15.73,Captions,,0,0,0,,A CELESTIAL DRAGON WILL VISITDialogue: 0,0:10:15.73,0:10:15.76,Captions,,0,0,0,,A CELESTIAL DRAGON WILL VISITDialogue: 0,0:10:15.76,0:10:15.79,Captions,,0,0,0,,A CELESTIAL DRAGON WILL VISITDia