logue: 0,0:10:18.30,0:10:18.33,Captions,,0,0,0,,A CELESTIAL DRAGON WILL VISITDialogue: 0,0:10:18.33,0:10:18.36,Captions,,0,0,0,,A CELESTIAL DRAGON WILL VISITDialogue: 0,0:10:18.36,0:10:18.43,Captions,,0,0,0,,A CELESTIAL DRAGON WILL VISITDialogue: 0,0:10:18.43,0:10:18.46,Captions,,0,0,0,,A CELESTIAL DRAGON WILL VISITDialogue: 0,0:10:18.46,0:10:18.50,Captions,,0,0,0,,A CELESTIAL DRAGON WILL VISITDialogue: 0,0:10:18.50,0:10:18.53,Captions,,0,0,0,,A CELESTIAL DRAGON WILL VISITDialogue: 0,0:10:18.53,0:10:18.56,Captions,,0,0,0,,A CELESTIAL DRAGON WILL VISITDialogue: 0,0:10:18.56,0:10:18.60,Captions,,0,0,0,,A CELESTIAL DRAGON WILL VISITDialogue: 0,0:10:18.60,0:10:18.66,Captions,,0,0,0,,A CELESTIAL DRAGON WILL VISITDialogue: 0,0:10:18.66,0:10:18.80,Captions,,0,0,0,,A CELESTIAL DRAGON WILL VISITDialogue: 0,0:10:18.80,0:10:18.86,Captions,,0,0,0,,A CELESTIAL DRAGON WILL VISITDialogue: 0,0:10:18.86,0:10:21.03,Captions,,0,0,0,,A CELESTIAL DRAGON WILL VISITDialogue: 0,0:10:28.01,0:10:30.44,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! I'm not hiding anything!Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.08,0:10:34.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, you aren't?Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.88,0:10:37.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, you are! Tell us, Sabo!Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.22,0:10:42.22,Main,,0,0,0,,We can't have secrets among us!Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.09,0:10:45.16,Main,,0,0,0,,– Tell us! – Tell us!Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.06,0:10:51.43,Main,,0,0,0,,I said that I'm not hiding...Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.73,0:10:54.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Tell us, you bastard! Or I'll beat you up!Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.50,0:10:58.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Alright, I'll tell you!Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.61,0:11:04.41,Main,,0,0,0,,The son of a noble?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.34,0:11:07.61,Main,,0,0,0,,– Who is? – Who is?Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.61,0:11:08.51,Main,,0,0,0,,I am!Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.25,0:11:12.15,Main,,0,0,0,,– And? – And?Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.15,0:11:14.39,Main,,0,0,0,,You two asked me!Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.72,0:11:21.16,Main,,0,0,0,,The truth is both of my parents are alive.Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.59,0:11:26.00,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not an orphan, and I didn't grow up in Gray Terminal.Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.70,0:11:29.37,Main,,0,0,0,,The man who called out to me today was...Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.64,0:11:31.97,Main,,0,0,0,,my father.Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.77,0:11:38.34,Main,,0,0,0,,I was lying to you guys. I'm sorry.Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.34,0:11:41.25,Main,,0,0,0,,He said "sorry" so we gotta forgive him.Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.25,0:11:43.98,Main,,0,0,0,,It depends. I'm confused.Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.55,0:11:48.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Why were you living there if you are from a noble family?Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.02,0:11:54.09,Main,,0,0,0,,I ran away because...Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.30,0:12:01.67,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Listen, Sabo.Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.37,0:12:07.97,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,You must develop the intelligence and manners becoming of a noble...Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.97,0:12:11.84,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,to eventually marry a princess.Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.84,0:12:16.48,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,If you do, our family's position will be secure. You will surely be happy, as well!Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.49,0:12:22.62,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Hello?! Hello?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.62,0:12:23.99,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Damn!Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.86,0:12:27.69,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Such a great loss! My word!Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.06,0:12:31.46,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Dad!Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.46,0:12:31.50,Sign-Dad,,0,0,0,,DADDialogue: 0,0:12:31.50,0:12:31.53,Sign-Dad,,0,0,0,,DADDialogue: 0,0:12:31.53,0:12:31.56,Sign-Dad,,0,0,0,,DADDialogue: 0,0:12:31.56,0:12:31.60,Sign-Dad,,0,0,0,,DADDialogue: 0,0:12:31.60,0:12:31.63,Sign-Dad,,0,0,0,,DADDialogue: 0,0:12:31.63,0:12:31.66,Sign-Dad,,0,0,0,,DADDialogue: 0,0:12:31.66,0:12:31.70,Sign-Dad,,0,0,0,,DADDialogue: 0,0:12:31.70,0:12:31.73,Sign-Dad,,0,0,0,,DADDialogue: 0,0:12:31.73,0:12:31.76,Sign-Dad,,0,0,0,,DADDialogue: 0,0:12:31.76,0:12:31.80,Sign-Dad,,0,0,0,,DADDialogue: 0,0:12:31.80,0:12:31.83,Sign-Dad,,0,0,0,,DADDialogue: 0,0:12:31.83,0:12:31.86,Sign-Dad,,0,0,0,,DADDialogue: 0,0:12:31.86,0:12:31.90,Sign-Dad,,0,0,0,,DADDialogue: 0,0:12:31.90,0:12:31.93,Sign-Dad,,0,0,0,,DADDialogue: 0,0:12:31.93,0:12:31.96,Sign-Dad,,0,0,0,,DADDialogue: 0,0:12:31.96,0:12:32.00,Sign-Dad,,0,0,0,,DADDialogue: 0,0:12:32.00,0:12:32.03,Sign-Dad,,0,0,0,,DADDialogue: 0,0:12:32.03,0:12:32.06,Sign-Dad,,0,0,0,,DADDialogue: 0,0:12:32.06,0:12:32.10,Sign-Dad,,0,0,0,,DADDialogue: 0,0:12:32.10,0:12:32.13,Sign-Dad,,0,0,0,,DADDialogue: 0,0:12:32.13,0:12:32.16,Sign-Dad,,0,0,0,,DADDialogue: 4,0:12:32.14,0:12:34.70,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Look at this! I drew it!Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.16,0:12:32.20,Sign-Dad,,0,0,0,,DADDialogue: 0,0:12:32.20,0:12:32.23,Sign-Dad,,0,0,0,,DADDialogue: 0,0:12:32.23,0:12:32.30,Sign-Dad,,0,0,0,,DADDialogue: 0,0:12:32.30,0:12:32.33,Sign-Dad,,0,0,0,,DADDialogue: 0,0:12:32.33,0:12:32.80,Sign-Dad,,0,0,0,,DADDialogue: 0,0:12:32.80,0:12:32.83,Sign-Dad,,0,0,0,,DADDialogue: 0,0:12:32.83,0:12:34.13,Sign-Dad,,0,0,0,,DADDialogue: 0,0:12:34.13,0:12:34.17,Sign-Dad,,0,0,0,,DADDialogue: 0,0:12:34.17,0:12:34.70,Sign-Dad,,0,0,0,,DADDialogue: 0,0:12:42.01,0:12:44.78,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'm exhausted from work, Sabo.Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.08,0:12:48.38,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,If you have time to draw this, you ought to be studying instead.Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.71,0:12:52.65,Sign-Dad,,0,0,0,,DADDialogue: 0,0:12:58.99,0:13:00.59,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Hey, you!Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.86,0:13:06.56,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'm royalty! That means I'm related to the king! Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.56,0:13:08.60,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Carry me piggyback to my house!Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.64,0:13:16.37,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Stop, you insolent swine!Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.37,0:13:19.88,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you gonna ignore a royal order?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.28,0:13:22.38,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Let me go!Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.85,0:13:31.52,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,You're just the son of some noble family!Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.92,0:13:33.49,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'll teach you a lesson!Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.06,0:13:37.46,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Stop it!Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.10,0:13:47.87,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,It's unforgivable to harm  a child of the royal family!Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.87,0:13:51.98,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Sabo! Did you really have  a fight with this royal boy?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.98,0:13:54.65,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Yes. I got hurt.Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.65,0:13:57.95,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,He suddenly came at me with a knife...Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.46,0:14:08.96,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry! He's not injured, is he?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.96,0:14:11.20,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry!Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.53,0:14:15.23,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Let's take him to a doctor to get checked out!Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.23,0:14:19.50,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Can we please settle this matter peacefully?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.57,0:14:26.11,Main,,0,0,0,,They love those who can maintain their status and defend their property.Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.55,0:14:30.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Not me!Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.85,0:14:37.72,Main,,0,0,0,,If I can't marry a woman from the royal family, I'm worthless!Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.72,0:14:40.89,Main,,0,0,0,,That's why they made me study and take culture lessons.Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.46,0:14:45.33,Main,,0,0,0,,And they were arguing everyday because I wasn't doing well.Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.16,0:14:48.57,Main,,0,0,0,,I had no place in that family!Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.40,0:14:53.74,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for both of you, but I was on my own even with parents!Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.64,0:15:00.15,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I heard that you sneak out and  go somewhere now and then.Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.91,0:15:06.22,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I doubt you would, but don't ever go anywhere near the Gray Terminal!Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.72,0:15:11.42,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,We nobles are privileged to live in High Town  with the king and his family.Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.42,0:15:17.06,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Those who live there are from a different world than we are!Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.70,0:15:23.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Nobles have a low opinion of the Gray Terminal,Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.80,0:15:26.70,Main,,0,0,0,,but it's better than that stifling High Town,Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.70,0:15:30.24,Main,,0,0,0,,where they decide your whole life for decades to come!Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.38,0:15:33.65,Main,,0,0,0,,I see.Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.58,0:15:36.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace! Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.45,0:15:40.32,Main,,0,0,0,,We gotta set out to sea someday!Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.75,0:15:43.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's get out of this country and be free!Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.82,0:15:48.46,Main,,0,0,0,,I wanna see the world out there and write a book about it!Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.46,0:15:51.23,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm happy to study if it's about sailing!Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.23,0:15:54.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's become stronger and become pirates someday!Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.91,0:16:04.24,Main,,0,0,0,,That was my plan anyway!  You don't have to tell me!Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.24,0:16:10.08,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be a pirate and beat everyone 'til I'm the most notorious pirate in the world!Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.65,0:16:13.65,Main,,0,0,0,,That's the only way I'll prove that I lived!Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.55,0:16:20.16,Main,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter if the whole world rejects or despises me,Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.89,0:16:23.49,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll become a great pirate and  show them what I can do!Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.33,0:16:27.33,Main,,0,0,0,,I won't run from anybody or lose to anyone!Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.33,0:16:30.27,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't care whether I'm feared or whatever;Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.27,0:16:32.37,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll make my name known worldwide!Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.37,0:16:37.36,Main,,0,0,0,,I see! Alright then!Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.38,0:16:42.88,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be...Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.92,0:16:53.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Sheesh, I was wondering what you'd have to say.Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.06,0:16:58.20,Main,,0,0,0,,You're funny, Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.20,0:17:01.40,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to see how you turn out!Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.50,0:17:05.64,Main,,0,0,0,,We can all be pirates, Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.64,0:17:09.24,Main,,0,0,0,,but isn't it a problem that we all wanna be captain?Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.17,0:17:12.01,Main,,0,0,0,,That's a hitch I didn't think of.Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.01,0:17:15.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Sabo, I thought that you'd wanna be navigator on my ship.Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.75,0:17:18.02,Main,,0,0,0,,You guys can come aboard my ship!Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.02,0:17:19.25,Main,,0,0,0,,– No way! – No way!Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.55,0:17:24.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, let's just leave it until the time comes.Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.72,0:17:28.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Maybe we'll set out independently.Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.13,0:17:31.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, you stole that from Dadan!Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.66,0:17:34.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Have ya heard?Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.90,0:17:39.00,Main,,0,0,0,,We can be brothers if we exchange sake cups.Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.17,0:17:42.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Brothers? Really?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.01,0:17:47.61,Main,,0,0,0,,When we're pirates,  we might not be on the same ship,Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.61,0:17:50.72,Main,,0,0,0,,but we'll always have our connection as brothers!Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.05,0:17:54.49,Main,,0,0,0,,No matter where we are or what we do, this bond will never be broken.Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.82,0:17:59.99,Main,,0,0,0,,From today onward,Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.79,0:18:02.06,Main,,0,0,0,,we're brothers!Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.87,0:18:10.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.20,0:19:18.07,Sign-Independent,,0,0,0,,We're going independent.Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.21,0:19:55.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Give him back!Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.44,0:19:59.51,Main,,0,0,0,,What do you mean "give him back"?  Sabo is my son.Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.51,0:20:01.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Children must live as their parents say...Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.98,0:20:03.78,Main,,0,0,0,,because their parents brought them into the world.Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.78,0:20:07.89,Main,,0,0,0,,How dare you two tempt Sabo to run away!?Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.89,0:20:10.35,Main,,0,0,0,,You thug-wannabe brats!Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.35,0:20:12.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you after my money?!Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.66,0:20:14.16,Main,,0,0,0,,What'd you say?!Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.66,0:20:20.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, pirate! Watch how you hit these kids!Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.97,0:20:23.77,Main,,0,0,0,,I've got that vermin's blood on me!Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.10,0:20:26.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace!Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.94,0:20:27.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Ack! Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.54,0:20:32.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop it! Nobody tempted me!Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.48,0:20:34.31,Main,,0,0,0,,I ran away of my own free will!Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.61,0:20:36.71,Main,,0,0,0,,You stay out of this! Take him.Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.72,0:20:41.09,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll leave the rest up to you, pirates.Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.09,0:20:44.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Of course, my lord .  You've already paid us.Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.46,0:20:50.90,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll make sure these two won't bother your boy again.Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.13,0:20:57.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute, Bluejam! Dad, that's enough! I understand!Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.04,0:21:00.17,Main,,0,0,0,,What do you understand?Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.67,0:21:02.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't do it, Sabo!Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.38,0:21:10.11,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll do as you say.  I'll live as you want, so...Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.11,0:21:14.82,Main,,0,0,0,,please don't hurt these two!Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.12,0:21:16.55,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you.Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.12,0:21:19.82,Main,,0,0,0,,They're very important to me;   they're my brothers.Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.96,0:21:22.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Sabo!Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.23,0:21:26.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Then go straight home.Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.96,0:21:30.67,Main,,0,0,0,,You should stop playing pirate. It's just a waste of time.Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.64,0:21:34.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! Don't go!Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.81,0:21:36.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Be quiet!Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.31,0:21:40.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Sabo, run! You don't have to worry about us!Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.85,0:21:43.31,Main,,0,0,0,,You said you wanna be free with us!Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.31,0:21:45.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Sabo, don't go!Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.18,0:21:48.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Is this how you want it to end?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.15,0:21:50.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Sabo!Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.49,0:21:54.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Sabo!Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.73,0:22:01.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Sabo!Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.11,0:22:10.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Captain! What should we do with these kids?Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.78,0:22:14.45,Main,,0,0,0,,– Take them to our hideout. – Yes, sir.Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.41,0:22:17.68,Main,,0,0,0,,You bastard! Untie me!Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.68,0:22:20.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Fight me again! I'm not gonna lose this time!Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.04,0:22:26.02,Main,,0,0,0,,It must be nice to be a noble, don't you think so, brats?Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.49,0:22:29.76,Main,,0,0,0,,They look down on others as if they're trash and boss everyone around.Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.76,0:22:32.66,Main,,0,0,0,,It's such an easy life.Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.66,0:22:35.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't that be grand?Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.70,0:22:37.74,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you getting at?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.74,0:22:41.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Being a pirate is way better! That's what Sabo said!Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.81,0:22:46.98,Main,,0,0,0,,I feel bad for you guys.  Hey, untie them.Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.98,0:22:47.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.91,0:22:51.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Why do you think a kid from a noble family...Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.58,0:22:53.92,Main,,0,0,0,,escaped to a place like the Gray Terminal?Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.12,0:23:01.09,Main,,0,0,0,,No doubt he did it to mock the people here, just like all nobles.Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.09,0:23:04.66,Main,,0,0,0,,I bet he looked down on you guys, too.Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.66,0:23:07.87,Main,,0,0,0,,That's not true! Sabo's not like that!Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.87,0:23:10.37,Main,,0,0,0,,He's right! We're brothers!Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.37,0:23:13.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah? Alright, I'm sorry.Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.21,0:23:18.91,Main,,0,0,0,,But you're not gonna bother that brat, are you?Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.91,0:23:20.71,Main,,0,0,0,,If you're planning on doing that,Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.71,0:23:23.75,Main,,0,0,0,,I'd have to kill you both right here.Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.75,0:23:27.59,Main,,0,0,0,,If you think of him as your brother, it's best to leave him alone.Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.09,0:23:31.92,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,For Sabo's good?Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.92,0:23:34.33,Main,,0,0,0,,But Sabo hates High Town!Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.63,0:23:39.43,Main,,0,0,0,,You have to let him go, if you really care about him.Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.43,0:23:42.27,Main,,0,0,0,,You'll understand when you get older. Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.63,0:23:47.20,Main,,0,0,0,,By the way, I had an axe to grind with you about Porchemy.Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.51,0:23:52.08,Main,,0,0,0,,But we can forget about it.  I rather liked your show of strength.Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.08,0:23:56.65,Main,,0,0,0,,That's why I wanted to ask you something. I think you might be interested.Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.65,0:24:03.15,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm short-handed now. Do you guys wanna work for me?Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.15,0:24:08.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, it's an easy task. It's not dangerous at all.Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.46,0:24:11.16,Main,,0,0,0,,There is a map of the Gray Terminal.Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.16,0:24:15.37,Main,,0,0,0,,All you have to do is carry packages to the places marked on the map.Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.37,0:24:16.63,Main,,0,0,0,,What'dya say? Are ya in?Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.63,0:24:17.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Alright.Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.27,0:24:20.44,Main,,0,0,0,,How much will you pay?Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.21,0:24:29.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace, I don't like it when Sabo is not around.Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.28,0:24:33.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Live with it. I don't like it, either.  I wanna rescue Sabo.Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.25,0:24:38.62,Main,,0,0,0,,But I don't know what's really best for him.Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.36,0:24:42.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's see how things go. He's fine.Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.43,0:24:45.76,Main,,0,0,0,,If he can't take it there, he can just come back.Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.43,0:24:50.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's make some money for our pirate stash, just in case.Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.07,0:24:54.87,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't say.  It's not Ace and Luffy's fault.Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.87,0:24:58.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Why can't you tell the truth?!Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.04,0:25:03.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Is it because they warned you not to say anything?Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.45,0:25:06.02,Main,,0,0,0,,They're not like that!Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.02,0:25:11.06,Main,,0,0,0,,If you have a criminal record, it will harm your family's reputation.Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.06,0:25:12.96,Main,,0,0,0,,You won't be able to enter High Town.Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.96,0:25:15.73,Main,,0,0,0,,You were tempted by those two,Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.73,0:25:19.20,Main,,0,0,0,,having no choice but to get involved in violence,Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.70,0:25:21.10,Main,,0,0,0,,weren't you, Sabo?Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.77,0:25:25.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Sabo.Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.10,0:25:28.61,Main,,0,0,0,,The fate of your friends in the Gray Terminal...Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.61,0:25:30.41,Main,,0,0,0,,is in the hands of those pirates.Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.41,0:25:32.94,Main,,0,0,0,,And I can give them an order.Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.94,0:25:35.48,Main,,0,0,0,,If they're that important to you,Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.48,0:25:37.98,Main,,0,0,0,,think about what you have to do.Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.82,0:25:45.22,Main,,0,0,0,,You're a smart boy. You know what you should do.Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.09,0:25:49.66,Main,,0,0,0,,You promised that you wouldn't hurt them!Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.66,0:25:52.30,Main,,0,0,0,,That's why I came back here!Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.30,0:25:56.80,Main,,0,0,0,,A crime is a crime!  We did it of our own free will.Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.74,0:26:01.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Honestly!Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.41,0:26:06.14,Main,,0,0,0,,It's so sad to have such a stupid son!Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.11,0:26:09.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Can't you understand my dilemma?Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.28,0:26:12.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, it must be so hard.Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.35,0:26:15.82,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of the papers.Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.06,0:26:21.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Welcome back, sir.Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.96,0:26:26.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay, Sabo, let's go.  It's been a long while since you left.Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.36,0:26:30.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't go in yet; you're filthy.Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.10,0:26:32.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Wash and disinfect your body in the yard first.Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.74,0:26:34.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Then take a bath.Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.87,0:26:37.74,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm glad that you're safe, Young Master.Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.21,0:26:42.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, Sabo! You're back. You got bigger.Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.01,0:26:44.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Mom.Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.92,0:26:47.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Now Sterry, say "hi" to your older brother.Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.12,0:26:52.82,Main,,0,0,0,,It's a pleasure to meet you, Brother! My name is Sterry. I'm 8.Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.56,0:26:54.79,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Who's he?Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.29,0:27:00.06,Main,,0,0,0,,We adopted him. He's a smart boy from a noble family.Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.06,0:27:04.40,Main,,0,0,0,,But for some reason,  his parents became negligent.Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.77,0:27:07.91,Main,,0,0,0,,We took him in since he's full of promise.Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.44,0:27:12.58,Main,,0,0,0,,If you don't work out to be my successor...Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.81,0:27:16.38,Main,,0,0,0,,No, I've said too much.Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.88,0:27:18.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Go to your room now.Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.28,0:27:20.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow, you have to start studying.Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.83,0:27:32.35,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Is this how you want it to end?!Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.53,0:27:39.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Brother! I heard that you're pretty stupid.Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.87,0:27:44.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Mother and Father are always implying that.Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.74,0:27:47.18,Main,,0,0,0,,You sure have the devil's luck.Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.18,0:27:49.78,Main,,0,0,0,,They're gonna take care of the burnables tomorrow night.Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.78,0:27:53.62,Main,,0,0,0,,If you had stayed in the Gray Terminal,Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.79,0:27:57.42,Main,,0,0,0,,you'd be dead.Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.52,0:28:01.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, it would've been better for me...Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.96,0:28:04.40,Main,,0,0,0,,if their real son didn't come home.Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.00,0:28:08.90,Main,,0,0,0,,W-W-What are you doing?! I'll tell Father!Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.90,0:28:11.64,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?!Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.64,0:28:13.94,Main,,0,0,0,,What's going on? Tell me everything!Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.94,0:28:19.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Th-There's gonna be a fire in the Gray Terminal tomorrow.Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.41,0:28:21.48,Main,,0,0,0,,– A fire?! – Yeah.Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.48,0:28:24.75,Main,,0,0,0,,You don't know about it  because you weren't here.Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.75,0:28:27.38,Main,,0,0,0,,But they decided it months ago.Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.99,0:28:29.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Did you know that the World Government...Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.85,0:28:32.42,Main,,0,0,0,,has sent a group of observers to go around the East Blue?Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.19,0:28:36.66,Main,,0,0,0,,They're finally gonna arrive in Goa in three days!Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.26,0:28:40.23,Main,,0,0,0,,This time, a world noble, a Celestial Dragon,Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.23,0:28:43.37,Main,,0,0,0,,is traveling with them. Everyone's in a panic!Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.37,0:28:48.34,Main,,0,0,0,,The royal family doesn't want him to see that stain on our country no matter what,Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.34,0:28:52.18,Main,,0,0,0,,so they decided to burn down the Gray Terminal.Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.61,0:28:55.75,Main,,0,0,0,,That oughta clean up this country!Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.75,0:29:00.88,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?  They can't do that!Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.88,0:29:04.46,Main,,0,0,0,,A lot of people live there!Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.46,0:29:06.99,Main,,0,0,0,,They can't take away their home!Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.99,0:29:07.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Let go of me!Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.46,0:29:11.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Weren't you listening to me?Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.10,0:29:17.10,Main,,0,0,0,,They're gonna burn out the taint that shames this country.Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.74,0:29:19.94,Main,,0,0,0,,You mean, the people, too?Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.71,0:29:27.71,Main,,0,0,0,,H-Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.91,0:29:31.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.85,0:29:37.52,Main,,0,0,0,,You can't just jump down...Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.83,0:29:44.09,Main,,0,0,0,,T-This has nothing to do with me.Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.50,0:29:46.93,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,It's a lie! He must be lying!Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.93,0:29:51.00,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,It's not possible to burn down an area so large!Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.47,0:29:57.54,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,They were there this afternoon.Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.01,0:30:02.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Are we ready for tomorrow? There can't be any miscalculation.Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.85,0:30:06.68,Main,,0,0,0,,We're ready, but the problem is the pirates.Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.68,0:30:09.32,Main,,0,0,0,,They have to set the fires according to plan.Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.22,0:30:13.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Bluejam's crew is setting boxes of oil and explosives...Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.76,0:30:17.80,Main,,0,0,0,,all over the Gray Terminal up until  the appointed time tomorrow.Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.76,0:30:22.43,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Bluejam has a hand in this? Then it must be true!Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.43,0:30:24.33,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,But it's so ridiculous!Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.15,0:30:37.51,Main,,0,0,0,,I wonder how Sabo's doing.Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.88,0:30:40.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up and go to sleep.Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.02,0:30:44.12,Main,,0,0,0,,We agreed to let go of Sabo for now.Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.69,0:30:45.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Alright.Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.49,0:30:49.46,Main,,0,0,0,,This could be better for him.Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.60,0:30:56.63,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I can figure out if there'll be a fire or not...Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.63,0:30:59.37,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,based on how everyone in town acts.Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.37,0:31:06.48,Main,,0,0,0,,– Hi, good morning! – Good morning!Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.48,0:31:09.91,Main,,0,0,0,,– Isn't it a lovely morning. – Yes, it is.Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.91,0:31:13.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh great! There is nothing wrong!Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.15,0:31:15.99,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll have a look throughout town.Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.52,0:31:20.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Today is windy.Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.69,0:31:24.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, indeed, Your Majesty.Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.03,0:31:29.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Accidents could easily happen on  a day like this; especially fires.Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.33,0:31:33.04,Main,,0,0,0,,You're right, Your Majesty.Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.34,0:31:36.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Sabo is not here?!Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.17,0:31:38.28,Main,,0,0,0,,That spoiled brat!Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.28,0:31:42.58,Main,,0,0,0,,He still wants to keep playing pirate without studying?!Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.11,0:31:44.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Search all of High Town!Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.32,0:31:47.99,Main,,0,0,0,,He couldn't have left High Town that easily!Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.25,0:31:52.12,Main,,0,0,0,,– Excuse me, mister. – What do you want?Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.46,0:31:56.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you know that there'll be a fire  in the Gray Terminal tonight?Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.36,0:32:00.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Of course, I know. What about it?Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.00,0:32:02.07,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,He knows?Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.07,0:32:04.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Whose family are you from?Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.07,0:32:07.54,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,So it's true!Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.11,0:32:10.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, kid!Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.41,0:32:13.31,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,What's going on here? Everybody knows about it?Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.64,0:32:16.51,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,They all know about it, yet they're acting normally?!Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.51,0:32:20.54,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Doesn't anyone care about  the fire in the Gray Terminal?!Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.42,0:32:27.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, there you are, little ones.Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.29,0:32:29.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Are there more boxes to carry today?Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.56,0:32:32.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and I have a big task for you tonight.Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.86,0:32:34.60,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you about it later. Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.60,0:32:36.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, I know.Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.77,0:32:41.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Why doesn't anyone in this town, including you, look concerned?Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.91,0:32:44.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Why does no one try to prevent it?Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.38,0:32:50.61,Main,,0,0,0,,You sound like you're a kind boy.Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.61,0:32:53.28,Main,,0,0,0,,But, listen carefully.Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.28,0:32:56.62,Main,,0,0,0,,We all have to keep quiet about the plan!Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.62,0:33:01.46,Main,,0,0,0,,What if someone outside  High Town finds out about it?Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.93,0:33:05.93,Main,,0,0,0,,We're special! If you're from a noble family...Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.50,0:33:08.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, you!Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.93,0:33:12.00,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Ace! Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.00,0:33:15.34,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,There's something wrong with this town!  Everybody's crazy!Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.74,0:33:17.67,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,They know that people will die,Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.67,0:33:20.51,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,but they act normally and even smile!Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.21,0:33:25.55,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna stay here! I gotta tell them immediately!Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.55,0:33:31.05,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Why'd it have to be windy today of all days?!Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.05,0:33:33.22,Main,,0,0,0,,There he is! Isn't that him?!Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.66,0:33:36.09,Main,,0,0,0,,There's no doubt! That's the runaway boy!Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.73,0:33:38.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey you, stop!Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.83,0:33:41.93,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Tonight, the people of this country are planning to set fire...Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.93,0:33:44.10,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,to their national shame!Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.84,0:33:48.41,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,You have to get out of Gray Terminal! Ace! Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.87,0:33:52.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Run! Ace! Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.31,0:33:55.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Why would you do that?!Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.71,0:34:01.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Idiot! Keep your voice down! We can't let anyone else know about this!Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.45,0:34:04.19,Main,,0,0,0,,This is serious! I gotta tell everybody!Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.19,0:34:06.16,Main,,0,0,0,,He's a bad guy, just as I thought!Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.16,0:34:09.89,Main,,0,0,0,,I told you to not to scream. Hey, hold them down.Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.30,0:34:13.66,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not the mastermind.Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.00,0:34:18.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Oil and explosives were in the boxes...Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.94,0:34:21.17,Main,,0,0,0,,that you guys carried yesterday and today.Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.17,0:34:26.34,Main,,0,0,0,,No one will escape the massive fire that's about to happen.Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.34,0:34:28.71,Main,,0,0,0,,– How could you? – Are you out of your mind?Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.15,0:34:33.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Even punk kids like you two are freaking out?Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.08,0:34:37.59,Main,,0,0,0,,But now you know about the plan.Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.99,0:34:41.86,Main,,0,0,0,,We can't let you go.Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.86,0:34:45.80,Main,,0,0,0,,I want to ask you something before the fire.Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.63,0:34:52.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Say, you two, do you have a treasure hidden away somewhere?Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.49,0:35:20.16,Captions,,0,0,0,,Edge TownDialogue: 1,0:35:16.49,0:35:20.16,Captions,,0,0,0,,Edge TownDialogue: 0,0:35:21.26,0:35:22.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up!Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.53,0:35:25.70,Main,,0,0,0,,H-Hey! Look over there!Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.07,0:35:32.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Something's wrong in Gray Terminal.Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.81,0:35:34.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Is it on fire?Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.55,0:35:42.12,Main,,0,0,0,,This is the best game I've ever played!Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.12,0:35:45.92,Main,,0,0,0,,B-B-Boss! Boss! You gotta see this!Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.22,0:35:47.82,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you screaming about?Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.82,0:35:50.59,Main,,0,0,0,,– The sky in the north, look! – Is that the town?!Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.93,0:35:55.74,Main,,0,0,0,,No, closer than that!  Must be the Gray Terminal! It's on fire!Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.13,0:35:59.90,Captions,,0,0,0,,MidtownDialogue: 1,0:35:57.13,0:35:59.90,Captions,,0,0,0,,MidtownDialogue: 0,0:35:57.53,0:35:59.90,Main,,0,0,0,,What's going on? It's like a wildfire!Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.90,0:36:03.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Gray Terminal has never caught fire before!Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.01,0:36:07.74,Main,,0,0,0,,It's dangerous; evacuate Edge Town!Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.74,0:36:10.38,Captions,,0,0,0,,Edge Town - Great GateDialogue: 1,0:36:07.74,0:36:10.38,Captions,,0,0,0,,Edge Town - Great GateDialogue: 0,0:36:07.74,0:36:10.38,Main,,0,0,0,,All residents must head to Midtown!Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.81,0:36:15.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Leave the lifesaving and fire extinguishing to us, the military! Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.69,0:36:21.83,Main,,0,0,0,,– Everybody, wake up! – We gotta get outta here!Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.39,0:36:28.60,Main,,0,0,0,,– The fire is spreading all around! – We can't stay here!Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.60,0:36:31.87,Main,,0,0,0,,It's no use, give it up! You gotta flee your home!Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.94,0:36:37.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh no! The fire has already reached the shore!Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.81,0:36:40.54,Main,,0,0,0,,The way to the forest is on fire, too!Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.54,0:36:43.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn! Where should we go?! We're stuck!Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.22,0:36:50.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Set it all ablaze, guys!Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.99,0:36:55.29,Main,,0,0,0,,When we complete this task,Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.29,0:36:58.50,Main,,0,0,0,,my long-cherished dream will come true!Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.90,0:37:01.03,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,You're right.Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.03,0:37:04.94,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,We don't give a damn about  the other people living here.Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.94,0:37:07.30,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,But no matter how crappy this place is,Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.30,0:37:11.11,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,it's good enough for our hideout, Your Majesty.Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.11,0:37:14.24,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'm aware of that, Bluejam.Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.24,0:37:18.52,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,But when this is over,  you no longer need to hide.Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.52,0:37:22.99,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I will use my authority to make you all nobles.Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.82,0:37:27.06,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Will you really?!Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.89,0:37:31.39,Main,,0,0,0,,The king will give us titles,Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.39,0:37:35.40,Main,,0,0,0,,and we'll live in High Town as privileged nobles!Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.34,0:37:45.98,Main,,0,0,0,,We better get moving.Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.31,0:37:49.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's get to the great gate! The military is waiting.Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.55,0:37:52.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Captain, we left the brats in the hideout.Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.25,0:37:57.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Forget 'em. They could've joined my crew, if they'd told me where the treasure was. Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.59,0:38:02.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Fools don't live long anyway.Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.36,0:38:08.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey Captain, it's closed!Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.10,0:38:12.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't panic. They just don't want other people to get away.Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.74,0:38:16.14,Main,,0,0,0,,The plan is for me to give them a sign, then they'll open the gate.Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.11,0:38:19.61,Main,,0,0,0,,It's me, Bluejam. Open up.Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.21,0:38:25.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! Do you hear me?!Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.59,0:38:29.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Is this...Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.89,0:38:33.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Captain, could it be...Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.62,0:38:40.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys, what are you doing?!  Open the gate!Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.06,0:38:44.07,Main,,0,0,0,,The plan was you let us evacuate from here, right?!Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.07,0:38:47.70,Main,,0,0,0,,This is not what we agreed to! You bastards!Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.70,0:38:50.27,Main,,0,0,0,,What happened to your promise, Your Majesty?!Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.27,0:38:53.58,Main,,0,0,0,,You said that you'd make us nobles...Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.88,0:38:58.08,Main,,0,0,0,,You set us up? You bastard!Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.08,0:39:00.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Dammit!Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.32,0:39:02.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Did you hear?Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.42,0:39:07.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Bluejam, a pirate in the Gray Terminal, started the fire.Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.29,0:39:11.03,Main,,0,0,0,,That's what I thought! No one else would do that.Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.03,0:39:15.77,Main,,0,0,0,,He did it to try to keep the observers from the World Government away.Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.77,0:39:17.63,Main,,0,0,0,,How terrible!Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.54,0:39:24.74,Main,,0,0,0,,It's hot! So hot!Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.74,0:39:25.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes!Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.98,0:39:28.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn! We got dragged into something horrible!Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.01,0:39:32.68,Main,,0,0,0,,We can't get away! I don't wanna die!Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.68,0:39:34.68,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll leave you behind if you don't stop complaining!Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.39,0:39:36.62,Main,,0,0,0,,It's not hot.Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.22,0:39:40.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Whoa, it's hot! No, it's not.Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.49,0:39:41.76,Main,,0,0,0,,The fire is everywhere outside!Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.63,0:39:44.09,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't breathe.Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.09,0:39:45.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, I can!Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.73,0:39:47.63,Main,,0,0,0,,The air is hot!Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.63,0:39:49.10,Main,,0,0,0,,No, it's not.Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.10,0:39:53.30,Main,,0,0,0,,It's gonna be alright! I'm here with you!Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.30,0:39:56.34,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?! You have to evacuate!Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.81,0:39:58.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Open the gate!Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.38,0:39:59.91,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?!Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.84,0:40:02.08,Main,,0,0,0,,You brat!Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.08,0:40:03.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Take him away!Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.15,0:40:07.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace! Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.12,0:40:08.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Run!Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.79,0:40:15.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Stay away! Stay away from the lock!Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.99,0:40:17.66,Main,,0,0,0,,No!Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.00,0:40:20.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace!Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.43,0:40:22.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.34,0:40:33.51,Main,,0,0,0,,– Be a good kid and evacuate! – Don't give us any trouble!Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.41,0:40:40.25,Main,,0,0,0,,A-Ace. Luffy.Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.67,0:41:04.64,Main,,0,0,0,,What happened to you, boy?Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.75,0:41:12.32,Main,,0,0,0,,O-Old man...Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.39,0:41:20.59,Main,,0,0,0,,The royalty and nobility are...  behind the fire...Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.49,0:41:25.23,Main,,0,0,0,,You gotta believe me!Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.76,0:41:32.07,Main,,0,0,0,,This town smells worse than the Gray Terminal.Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.64,0:41:36.44,Main,,0,0,0,,It smells like rotten people!Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.64,0:41:43.58,Main,,0,0,0,,If I stay here, I'll never be free!Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.65,0:41:46.95,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm...Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.95,0:41:49.89,Main,,0,0,0,,ashamed of being born a noble!Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.45,0:41:55.69,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Look what you've made this boy say, Goa!Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.39,0:42:01.90,Main,,0,0,0,,I know how you feel.  I was born here, too.Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.87,0:42:08.54,Main,,0,0,0,,But I still don't have enough power to change it.Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.54,0:42:12.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Old man, you really are listening to me, aren't you?Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.81,0:42:15.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, and I'll never forget.[Aegisub Extradata]Data: 5,a-mo,eA CELESTIAL DRAGON WILL VISIT"}Data: 8,a-mo,eDAD"}Data: 51,a-mo,ePalace"}Data: 52,a-mo,em -57 -55 l 58 -55 58 5 -57 5"}Data: 53,a-mo,eWindmill  Village"}Data: 54,a-mo,em -59 -72 l 66 -72 66 -5 -59 -5"}Data: 75,a-mo,eMt. Corvo"}Data: 76,a-mo,em -82 -57 l 63 -57 63 7 -82 7"}Data: 77,a-mo,eGray  Terminal"}Data: 78,a-mo,em -62 -73 l 66 -73 66 15 -62 15"}Data: 79,a-mo,eEdge  Town"}Data: 80,a-mo,em -52 -71 l 44 -71 44 -2 -52 -2"}Data: 81,a-mo,eCentral  Town"}Data: 82,a-mo,em -61 -73 l 67 -73 67 2 -61 2"}Data: 83,a-mo,eHigh Town"}Data: 84,a-mo,em -64 -54 l 67 -54 67 20 -64 20"}